d). Live smoke green.\n18\t\n19\t### Wave 2 â€” Morning glance panel â€” âœ… GREEN (2026-06-11)\n20\t\n21\t- **Status:** converged with 0 fix-iterations; committed `6d38b81`.\n22\t- **Files:** `dashboard/data/reports.py` (read_morning_summary/read_briefing_note/read_latest_weekly â€” all fail soft), `dashboard/data/costs.py` (cost_rollup: nightly/MTD/project-total), `dashboard/web/blueprint.py` (`/api/morning`), `dashboard/web/static/{dashboard.js (markdown helper),morning.js,dashboard.css,dashboard.html}`, tests extended.\n23\t- **done-when met:** `/api/morning` returns parsed summary + briefing + weekly + cost rollup; the panel renders top-finds as named cards with why + quality, the adoption line carries window + sample_size (thin-window trap handled), the spend block shows nightly/MTD/project; a missing `latest_summary.json` degrades to a soft empty-state (no 500).\n24\t- **Live smoke:** productivity 23.8% (all-time, n=21); top finds archive-crawler/benchmark-due-diligence/academic-verify; costs nightly $1.02 Â· MTD anthropic $10.12 Â· project $21.11; noise 65; briefing + weekly 2026-06-11 present.\n25\t- **Gate:** 23 passed (+9), 1029 deselected. JS node --check clean.\n26\t\n27\t### Wave 3 â€” Errors/health panel (signals + in-page detail) â€” âœ… GREEN (2026-06-11)\n28\t\n29\t- **Status:** converged with 1 self-review fix (count/examples fidelity note); committed `20fa1eb`.\n30\t- **Files:** `dashboard/config.py` (+logs_dir), `dashboard/data/health.py` (new), `dashboard/web/blueprint.py` (`/api/health` full object + `/api/health/detail`), `dashboard/web/static/{health.js,dashboard.css,dashboard.html}`, `tests/{dashboard_fixtures(+library/logs),test_dashboard_health}.py`.\n31\t- **G3 met:** signals (run degrade, noise categories, backfill audits, rejects, logs) each expand in-page to detail (log tail / noise examples / backfill JSON / reject rows).\n32\t- **Security (hard constraint #2):** `sweep_log_tail` allowlists bare `*.log` names resolved strictly within